  "notes": "Backlog game, all-AAA pass: picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year across all genres (docs/PLAN.md section 2, genre filter widened 2026-10-23). None of the 58 Steam achievements is hidden. The Steam store list spells the app \"Mortal Kombat11\" (app 976310); the schema calls it \"Mortal Kombat 11\". StrategyWiki has a page at completion stage 0; only its \"Table of Contents\" subpage exists (about 3,200 characters). It links 17 story chapter pages (\"Chapter 1: Next of Kin\" to \"Chapter 17: Checkmate\"), fighter pages and an \"Achievements and trophies\" page, but none of them is written, so nothing was used and the story is a single chapter here. mortalkombat.fandom.com answers the API, with about 306 linked pages; names only were looked at, nothing copied."
